<title>UK: Lex yr pretax rises 22 percent pre-exceps.</title>
<headline>Lex yr pretax rises 22 percent pre-exceps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr(pence, pre-exceps) 31.3		   vs 27.5</p>
